Package: autonomic-agent
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, adduser
Description: agent-native identity layer for Debian and Ubuntu
 Gives the agent an identity in the system instead of a process:
 a dedicated system user, a hardened systemd unit, its own cgroup
 quota, its own journal namespace, and a read-only world-version
 marker used to detect changes that bypassed the Action channel.
 .
 Part of Autonomic OS -- a research prototype. It reuses the Debian
 and Ubuntu bones (kernel, glibc, systemd, dpkg) and adds a layer of
 agent-native defaults. No warranty beyond "this release built and
 ran at the time it was published".
